  "purpose": "Evidence-traceable dietary carbohydrate parameters for a PCOS research or educational tool. These values are literature-derived observations and intervention definitions, not individualized medical prescriptions.",
  "interpretation_rules": [
    "Do not present the healthy-women cohort in PMID 26066675 as a PCOS cohort or as evidence of a PCOS treatment target.",
    "The <45% energy carbohydrate threshold in PMID 31885557 is the operational low-carbohydrate definition used by that meta-analysis, not a universally endorsed clinical target.",
    "No universally optimal carbohydrate grams-per-day target for all women with PCOS is established by the cited reviews.",
    "Keep each numeric value attached to its source, population, comparator, unit, and evidence context."
